"According to the *CIA World Factbook*:\n\n| Country | Space agency (name) | Year established |\n|---------|----------------------|------------------|\n| Argentina | National Space Activities Commission (CONAE) | 1991 |\n| Brazil | Brazilian Space Agency (AEB) | 1994 |\n| Peru | National Aerospace Research and Development Commission (CONIDA) | 1974 |\n\nThese are the only coastal South American nations listed in the Factbook whose space agencies were created **before 2000**.  \n\n**Answer:** **Three** coastal South American countries\u2014Argentina, Brazil, and Peru\u2014established a space agency before the year 2000."